id: pm-rust-oracle-malformed-recency
title: Track published context failure on malformed history patch paths
description: "With the pinned pm-cli 2026.11.18, context exits 0 on a clean synthetic tracker. Adding an update record with a patch object lacking path makes context exit 1 with unknown_error while stale-work skips that record. Native orientation now ignores invalid recency evidence. Check whether a later published release handles malformed paths consistently and extend the differential when it does."
